  - m_Id: 7662735655100416
    m_Localized: 'Salut je suis benoit '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7662735697043456
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7664854604898304
    m_Localized: 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7664854571343872
    m_Localized: Choisi 1 ou 2 ou 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7664854604898305
    m_Localized: 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7664922703618048
    m_Localized: 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674215982145536
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674216066031616
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674387986358272
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674387982163968
    m_Localized: Hey You ther could you pick that cube and bring it to me ??
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674387986358273
    m_Localized: NO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674626029887488
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674743566868480
    m_Localized: OK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674743566868481
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674919694082048
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7674919694082049
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675007506030592
    m_Localized: BRING ME MY CUBE!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675007506030593
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675092155473920
    m_Localized: Merci
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675092155473921
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675269461286912
    m_Localized: A tu ramener mon cube
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675269469675520
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7675269469675521
    m_Localized: No
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7677177844441088
    m_Localized: Do you want to take the cubeBenoit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7677177924132864
    m_Localized: Oui
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7677177924132865
    m_Localized: NON
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7677413950201856
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7716713366528001
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7716713366528000
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7716713366528002
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14192599409020928
    m_Localized: "Ugh, this water won\u2019t drain, it\u2019s flooding the incinerator.
      Whose idea was it to build it in a hollow like this?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14192599442575360
    m_Localized: "Things were different back then. They probably didn\u2019t think
      this would happen."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14192599442575361
    m_Localized: "What if we looked at the solution instead of looking for someone
      to blame? That plant over there\u2026 if we make it grow, it could drink up
      all this water."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14192599442575362
    m_Localized: "Indeed\u2026 you were right. Better to act today than to redo the
      past. Thank you so much."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14192599446769664
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14192599446769665
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14192599446769666
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14192599446769667
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193745842327552
    m_Localized: "The incinerator is overheating! The river is supposed to prevent
      that\u2026 but it\u2019s run dry!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193745842327553
    m_Localized: "Panicking won\u2019t help anything. Let\u2019s stay calm. We\u2019ll
      look at this step by step. Show me where the water used to flow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193745842327554
    m_Localized: "Phew\u2026 it wasn't such a big deal after all. Panicking only
      made things harder. Good thing you kept your cool."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193745842327555
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193745842327556
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193745842327557
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193771729571840
    m_Localized: "The incinerator is out of wood! It\u2019s going to stop, and the
      Portal of Renewal will go out!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193771729571841
    m_Localized: "Whoa! That is serious, true. But there\u2019s no need to panic
      like this. Let\u2019s focus on the solution. What can we do?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193771729571842
    m_Localized: "Over there, there\u2019s a log\u2026 but I\u2019ll never have time
      to drag it all the way here!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193771729571843
    m_Localized: "Breathe. That log \u2014 I can bring it over, no problem."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193771729571844
    m_Localized: (The player uses Push/Pull to bring the log back.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193771729571845
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193771729571846
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193771729571847
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193771729571848
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193771729571849
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193868248895488
    m_Localized: "Ugh, this lake\u2026 what a pain."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193868248895489
    m_Localized: "What\u2019s bothering you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193868248895490
    m_Localized: "So, we\u2019re supposed to reach the incinerator islet by bouncing
      off this big plant. But the truth is\u2026 I\u2019m afraid of heights."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193868248895491
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s okay. We all have our strengths and weaknesses. That
      plant surely isn\u2019t the only option \u2014 here, I can lend you one of
      my powers."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193868248895492
    m_Localized: (The player shares the Swim power with Emmanuel.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193868248895493
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193868248895494
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193868248895495
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193868248895496
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193868248895497
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193914210078720
    m_Localized: "Ugh, this dull patch appeared right on top of the incinerator.
      It\u2019s unusable like this. What do we do? We\u2019re not going to rebuild
      it just for that, surely?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193914210078721
    m_Localized: No need. I think we can clear it by relighting the lanterns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193914210078722
    m_Localized: "Except one of them is broken\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193914210078723
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve seen Yto craftspeople fix a broken lantern by tucking
      a firefly inside. It\u2019s worth a try."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193914210078724
    m_Localized: (The player lights the lanterns and repairs the broken one using
      a firefly.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193914210078725
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193914210078726
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193914210078727
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193914210078728
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193914210078729
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193958854250496
    m_Localized: "You look deep in thought\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193958854250497
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m trying to figure out how to drain the river."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193958854250498
    m_Localized: Sorry?! But why?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193958854250499
    m_Localized: "Because ever since it filled back up, the lumberjack robots have
      been stuck on the other side. We can\u2019t do anything without them. So I\u2019m
      looking for a fix."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193958854250500
    m_Localized: "Hmm\u2026 there\u2019s probably a simpler way to get them across
      a river. Like a bridge, for example."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193958854250501
    m_Localized: (The player creates a bridge and helps the lumberjack robots cross
      the river.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193958854250502
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193958854250503
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193958854250504
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193958854250505
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193958854250506
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14193958854250507
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194013229207552
    m_Localized: "Hey there! I fell in here looking for wood\u2026 I fix other people\u2019s
      bridges, and now here I am, stuck. If that isn\u2019t the last straw!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194013229207553
    m_Localized: "It happens to the best of us. Hang on, I\u2019ll make you a platform."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194013229207554
    m_Localized: (The player creates platforms to get the builder out of the hole.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194013229207555
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194013229207556
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194013229207557
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194040605429760
    m_Localized: "Hi\u2026 I\u2019m Lily. And this is George."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194040605429761
    m_Localized: "He\u2019s barely eating anymore. I don\u2019t understand\u2026
      Maybe he\u2019s sick? What\u2019s wrong, George?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194040605429762
    m_Localized: "We can start by looking at what he\u2019s showing us. Maybe something\u2019s
      missing for him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194040605429763
    m_Localized: "Yes\u2026 but what? He used to be so much livelier."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194040605429764
    m_Localized: (The player uses their emotional-sensitivity power. George seems
      sad.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194040605429765
    m_Localized: "He looks sad\u2026 Are you sad, George? We don\u2019t know why
      yet. What if we looked together with George for what he needs to feel good?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194040605429766
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194040605429767
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194040605429768
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194040605429769
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194040605429770
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194040605429771
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055296
    m_Localized: "We keep the incinerator running for everyone, but it feels like
      no one sees the effort it takes. Without us, the Portal of Renewal wouldn\u2019t
      even work."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055297
    m_Localized: What do you think, George?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055298
    m_Localized: (George turns his head away and stays nestled against Lily.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055299
    m_Localized: "Hmm\u2026 that doesn\u2019t seem right for him. And besides, we
      don\u2019t have a well here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055300
    m_Localized: How about a river, George?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055301
    m_Localized: (George curls up and presses against Lily.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055302
    m_Localized: "That doesn\u2019t seem right for him. With the current, it would
      surely be too rough for him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055303
    m_Localized: "Yes\u2026 a calm lake could be a lead. But let\u2019s see what
      George thinks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055304
    m_Localized: What do you think, George?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055305
    m_Localized: (George perks up slightly, croaks, and reacts positively to the
      mention of the lake.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055306
    m_Localized: Looks like he likes the idea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055307
    m_Localized: I can help you find a spot. Then you can set it up with him, watching
      what suits him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241760055308
    m_Localized: "Yes! I\u2019ll offer him reeds, water lilies\u2026 and I\u2019ll
      see what he likes best."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249600
    m_Localized: What would you want them to understand? And what would you need
      for things to go better?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249601
    m_Localized: "And you \u2014 what do you actually know about what they\u2019re
      going through with the fruit?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249602
    m_Localized: Can you show me how the incinerator powers the portal?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249603
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249604
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249605
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249606
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249607
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249608
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249609
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249610
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249611
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249612
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249613
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194241764249614
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751680
    m_Localized: "Tom\u2026 a moment ago, you looked really frustrated. Is that right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751681
    m_Localized: "Yes, that\u2019s it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751682
    m_Localized: What bothers you most in this situation?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751683
    m_Localized: "I\u2019d like them to see that what we do here serves everyone,
      not just us. And to acknowledge our efforts a little, instead of only seeing
      what\u2019s wrong."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751684
    m_Localized: "Not enough, probably. We mostly only end up talking when we\u2019re
      already angry."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751685
    m_Localized: "Yes. Come see. You\u2019ll understand why it matters so much to
      us. It powers the Portal of Renewal."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751686
    m_Localized: "Maybe\u2026 I\u2019m still annoyed, but yes. It would be better
      to know before accusing them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751687
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751688
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751689
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751690
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751691
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751692
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194415911751693
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194591707615232
    m_Localized: (The builder puts up a small log shelter for the fox cub in the
      village.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194591707615233
    m_Localized: There you go. You can come here if you like. This is your spot now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194591707615234
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194591707615235
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194651178651648
    m_Localized: Some people from the volcano biome need wood to build. Could I have
      some?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194651178651649
    m_Localized: "Yes, of course \u2014 the trouble is the forest is starting to
      dull, and so are our wood reserves. We\u2019ve tried everything, but nothing
      works\u2026 As long as our wood reserves stay dull, we won\u2019t have any
      wood to give you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194651178651650
    m_Localized: "We\u2019ve rarely truly tried everything. Let\u2019s try to find
      another solution together. Maybe a single power isn\u2019t enough."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194651178651651
    m_Localized: "I\u2019d have told you to light the lanterns, like in many other
      dull areas \u2014 except there aren\u2019t any here. We need to find another
      way."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194651178651652
    m_Localized: (The player shares the Light power with the NPC, and together they
      use Light at the same time to gradually revive the dull area.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194651178651653
    m_Localized: It worked! Sometimes there really is strength in joining forces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194651178651654
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194651178651655
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194651178651656
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194651178651657
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194651178651658
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14194651178651659
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14221042163044352
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14221042175627264
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14221042175627265
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14221042175627266
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14221042175627267
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14221042175627268
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14221042175627269
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14221042175627270
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14221042175627271
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14221042175627272
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14221042175627273
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14221042175627274
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508184649728
    m_Localized: (George turns his head away and stays nestled against Lily.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232640
    m_Localized: "Hmm\u2026 that doesn\u2019t seem right for him. And besides, we
      don\u2019t have a well here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232641
    m_Localized: (George curls up and presses against Lily.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232642
    m_Localized: "That doesn\u2019t seem right for him. With the current, it would
      surely be too rough for him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232643
    m_Localized: What do you think, George?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232644
    m_Localized: (George perks up slightly, croaks, and reacts positively to the
      mention of the lake.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232645
    m_Localized: Looks like he likes the idea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232646
    m_Localized: I can help you find a spot. Then you can set it up with him, watching
      what suits him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232647
    m_Localized: "Yes! I\u2019ll offer him reeds, water lilies\u2026 and I\u2019ll
      see what he likes best."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232648
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232649
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232650
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232651
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232652
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232653
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232654
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232655
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231508197232656
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231612207583232
    m_Localized: "Two accounts, two needs. Go see the systems for yourself before
      you go back to them. Harry feels misunderstood. To grasp the whole story, go
      see the incinerator with your own eyes: you\u2019ll understand how important
      it is for everyone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231612207583233
    m_Localized: "Harry, you look like you\u2019re really at the end of your rope\u2026
      Is that it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231612207583234
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231612207583235
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726393315328
    m_Localized: "Your J\xE9mytos are eating our fruit! We grow it for them, and
      now we\u2019re the ones starting to run short. It\u2019s not our job to feed
      them for you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509632
    m_Localized: And we keep the incinerator running for everyone! It feels like
      nobody notices. And what do we get for it? Blame!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509633
    m_Localized: "Wait\u2026 right now you\u2019re both too worked up to really hear
      each other."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509634
    m_Localized: We can try to talk it through, but maybe not like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509635
    m_Localized: This has gone on too long! The Ytorale only ever see their own needs!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509636
    m_Localized: "And you always see what we don\u2019t do. Never everything we already
      do!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509637
    m_Localized: "(They start talking over each other again. The tension doesn\u2019t
      ease.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509638
    m_Localized: "Okay\u2026 pushing on now won\u2019t fix anything. First I\u2019ll
      try to understand what\u2019s going on for each of them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509639
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509640
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509641
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509642
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509643
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509644
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509645
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231726397509646
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799936
    m_Localized: (George turns his head away and stays nestled against Lily.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799937
    m_Localized: "Hmm\u2026 that doesn\u2019t seem right for him. And besides, we
      don\u2019t have a well here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799938
    m_Localized: (George curls up and presses against Lily.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799939
    m_Localized: "That doesn\u2019t seem right for him. With the current, it would
      surely be too rough for him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799940
    m_Localized: What do you think, George?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799941
    m_Localized: (George perks up slightly, croaks, and reacts positively to the
      mention of the lake.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799942
    m_Localized: Looks like he likes the idea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799943
    m_Localized: I can help you find a spot. Then you can set it up with him, watching
      what suits him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799944
    m_Localized: "Yes! I\u2019ll offer him reeds, water lilies\u2026 and I\u2019ll
      see what he likes best."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799945
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799946
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799947
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799948
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799949
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799950
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799951
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799952
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231879493799953
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231990550581248
    m_Localized: "Before you go back to them, listen with your emotional sensitivity.
      Don\u2019t stop at their words alone\u2026 look at what they seem to feel behind
      their anger. Listening is often the first step toward calming things."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231990550581249
    m_Localized: "(Player action: they use their emotional sensitivity to sense Tom\u2019s
      and Harry\u2019s emotions.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231990550581250
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14231990550581251
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232064613601280
    m_Localized: "Two accounts, two needs. Go see the systems for yourself before
      you go back to them. Harry feels misunderstood. To grasp the whole story, go
      see the incinerator with your own eyes: you\u2019ll understand how important
      it is for everyone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232064613601281
    m_Localized: "Harry, you look like you\u2019re really at the end of your rope\u2026
      Is that it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232064613601282
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232064613601283
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232124449542144
    m_Localized: (Tom and Harry meet again. The tension has eased, but they stay
      on their guard.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232124449542145
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve talked with both of you. Shall we try a different way?
      This time, say what you need, without starting from what the other does wrong.
      And think about what you could actually ask of each other."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232124449542146
    m_Localized: Tom, instead of saying what the Ytorale do wrong, what would you
      actually want to ask them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232124449542147
    m_Localized: "All right\u2026 Harry, I understand better now that the incinerator
      serves everyone. But on our side, the fruit is really starting to run short.
      Can we figure out together how to keep too many J\xE9mytos from coming to feed
      at our place?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232124449542148
    m_Localized: "Yes\u2026 I understand better now why that worries you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232124449542149
    m_Localized: And you, Harry? Taking into account what Tom just said, what would
      you want to ask?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232124449542150
    m_Localized: "I\u2019d like us to find a solution that lets the incinerator keep
      running, without the Phytos feeling like they carry everything. Can we look
      together at how to share the fruit and the effort better?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232124449542151
    m_Localized: Yes. That, we can try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232124449542152
    m_Localized: "Then that\u2019s where we start."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232124449542153
