  - m_Id: 14232169638973440
    m_Localized: (A lone fox cub tries to make itself understood. The player uses
      emotional sensitivity.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232169638973441
    m_Localized: "You can\u2019t tell me in words\u2026 but you look really lonely."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232169638973442
    m_Localized: (The fox cub flattens itself to the ground, ears down.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232169638973443
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232169638973444
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232169638973445
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232230267637760
    m_Localized: "Hey! I\u2019m under here! Everyone walks right past without daring
      to come closer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232230267637761
    m_Localized: "Okay. Hang on, I\u2019ll clear away the leaves\u2026 gently."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14232230267637762
    m_Localized: (The player uses Push to clear away the foliage.)
